Package: fosos-desktop
Version: 1.5.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-pamela, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-wnck-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91, gir1.2-lightdm-1, lightdm, python3-xlib, openbox, xss-lock, xcape, brightnessctl, xsettingsd, arandr, scrot, x11-xkb-utils, x11-xserver-utils, network-manager, network-manager-gnome, gvfs, wireplumber, fonts-inter, fonts-liberation, adwaita-icon-theme, pkexec, fosos-theme
Recommends: freerdp3-x11, freerdp3-shadow-x11
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS Desktop session
 The FosOS panel, Start menu, desktop, Files, Terminal, Notepad,
 Remote Desktop client, notifications, lock screen, LightDM greeter and
 settings shell, running on the Openbox window manager. It is the default
 login session. A minimal FosOS Recovery session and text consoles are the
 fallback when the shell fails. Inbound RDP shares the console via FreeRDP
 shadow when installed; enable it from Settings → Remote Desktop.
